      "tag": "Grid",
      "h2": "Grids Give Order",
      "body_html": "<p>Designers split the page into invisible columns — a <strong>grid</strong>. Aligning elements to the grid makes everything feel tidy and intentional, like a magazine page.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Empty",
      "h2": "Whitespace Helps",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>Whitespace</strong> isn't wasted — it gives the eye places to rest and makes important parts stand out. Cluttered designs lose readers.</p>"
